OL,3,AJapan raises permanent residency fee by
OL,4,A20 times
OL,5,
OL,6,FJapan has raised fees for foreigners
OL,7,Fseeking permanent residency in the
OL,8,Fcountry by 20 times to 200,000 yen
OL,9,F($1,270; #955).
OL,11,FThose seeking permanent residency must
OL,12,Fnow also meet new income, pension and
OL,13,FJapanese-language requirements.
OL,15,FLong lines formed outside immigration
OL,16,Foffices earlier this week as applicants
OL,17,Fsought to beat the fee hikes, with
OL,18,FTokyo's main immigration bureau
OL,19,Freporting wait times of over seven
OL,20,Fhours.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
