OL,3,AJapan raises permanent residency fee by
OL,4,A20 times
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fee increases are part of a series
OL,7,Fof changes to Japan's immigration
OL,8,Fpolicy under Prime Minister Sanae
OL,9,FTakaichi, which aim to manage its
OL,10,Frapidly growing foreign population.
